From a9545fec26dc7942e2642a93b85e019e3dd5f612 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: James Hilliard <james.hilliard1@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 2 Nov 2026 12:55:18 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 5/9] dt-bindings: serial: snps-dw-apb-uart: add Allwinner H616

The H616 UART has 256-byte transmit and receive FIFOs, but its DesignWare
component parameter register does not report the FIFO depth. Its optional
register layout also differs from the generic DesignWare integration.

Add a specific compatible to identify this fixed configuration, retaining
snps,dw-apb-uart as a fallback.

Signed-off-by: James Hilliard <james.hilliard1@gmail.com>
Acked-by: Krzysztof Kozlowski <krzysztof.kozlowski@oss.qualcomm.com>
---
 Documentation/devicetree/bindings/serial/snps-dw-apb-uart.yaml | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/serial/snps-dw-apb-uart.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/serial/snps-dw-apb-uart.yaml
index 664305d..d359988 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/serial/snps-dw-apb-uart.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/serial/snps-dw-apb-uart.yaml
@@ -51,6 +51,7 @@ properties:
           - const: renesas,rzn1-uart
       - items:
           - enum:
+              - allwinner,sun50i-h616-uart
               - anlogic,dr1v90-uart
               - brcm,bcm11351-dw-apb-uart
               - brcm,bcm21664-dw-apb-uart
